# Popup Handler — a draggable white dot; tapping it measures it on the UI thread and
# opens a blurred popup menu (Top Left / Top Right / Bottom Left / Bottom Right)
# anchored above/below and left/right of it; picking an option springs the dot
# to that corner 800ms later.
# What this test covers: open and dismiss by tapping the blurred backdrop;
# every option, visiting all four corners so the menu is laid out in all four
# alignments; dragging the dot to the middle and opening the menu there;
# tapping the dot again during the 800ms delay; dragging the dot while its
# corner spring is running; double-tapping the dot.
# Menu rows are 54pt tall and their labels end with an icon glyph, so they are
# pressed by position. The top-right dot is tapped at its lower-left (312,176)
# because the floating dev-tools gear above it swallows taps near (338,150).
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/popup-handler"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 10000
wait 2500
# Open at top-left, dismiss on the backdrop.
press 64 150
wait "text" "Top Left" 3000
wait 700
press 220 650
wait 900
# Top-left -> Bottom Right (menu below-left of the dot).
press 64 150
wait 800
press 108 376
wait 2500
# Bottom-right -> Bottom Left (menu above-right).
press 338 778
wait 800
press 262 660
wait 2500
# Bottom-left -> Top Right (menu above-left).
press 64 778
wait 800
press 108 606
wait 2500
# Top-right -> Top Left (menu below-right).
press 312 176
wait 800
press 262 214
wait 2500
# Drag the dot to the middle, open the menu there, dismiss.
gesture pan 64 150 136 300 700
wait 600
press 200 450
wait 800
press 60 300
wait 900
# Pick Bottom Right, then grab the dot during the 800ms delay.
press 200 450
wait 800
press 168 568
wait 300
press 200 450
wait 800
press 60 300
wait 1500
# Dot is at bottom-right: pick Top Left and drag it while it springs.
press 338 778
wait 800
press 262 552
wait 950
gesture pan 300 500 -100 100 400
wait 1500
press 64 150 --count 2
wait 1200
press 220 650
wait 1200
wait "label=\"Close\"" 3000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\" id=\"xmark\""
wait 1500
